sequenceDiagram
    participant User as PUQ_DEMO_USER
    participant SF as Snowflake Service
    participant Block as Block Pipeline
    participant Eval as Eval Task (TIER_1H)
    participant Admin as PUQ_QUOTA_ADMIN_ROLE

    Note over User, Admin: PUQ Normal Operation

    User->>SF: AI_COMPLETE() request
    SF->>User: Response
    SF-->>Block: Usage event (minutes)

    Note over User, Admin: PUQ Block Enforcement (AI Only)

    Block->>Block: Compare PUQ_DEMO_USER spend vs PUQ_AI_STANDARD_QUOTA limit (100)
    alt Spend >= 100 AI credits
        Block->>User: Block + email notification
        User->>SF: Next AI request
        SF->>User: Error: Quota Exhausted (PUQ_AI_STANDARD_QUOTA)
    end

    Note over User, Admin: PUQ Evaluation Task (TIER_1H)

    Eval->>Eval: Aggregate per-user usage
    alt 80% Projected threshold
        Eval->>User: Warning email (once per 24h)
        Eval->>Admin: Admin summary
    end

    Note over User, Admin: PUQ Escalation

    Admin->>SF: ALTER USER PUQ_DEMO_USER SET TAG USAGE_TIER = 'high'
    Block->>Block: Clear standard-tier blocks (~15 min)
    Block->>Block: Evaluate against PUQ_AI_HIGH_TIER_QUOTA (500)
    User->>SF: AI request succeeds (under 500 limit)
